 V, STRAIGHT THROUGH" (at 116.84 220.98 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "c8dfc413-2626-4633-b6f5-e6c0cd18566b"))(text "The MPG runs at 5 V and shares ground with the port, so it needs no" (at 116.84 231.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "0f675e2e-1133-4b12-9fff-16ce35798351"))(text "optocoupler - only a series resistor and a pull-up, because most" (at 116.84 236.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "f4f56484-68d7-46a8-b52d-666da982831a"))(text "handwheels drive their outputs open-collector." (at 116.84 241.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "2b1adb72-d96e-4403-b337-6e48239de428"))(wire (pts (xy 154.94 267.97)(xy 162.56 267.97)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "bc870f37-9eeb-45da-bb20-d85944ff7783"))(global_label "MPG_5V" (shape passive) (at 162.56 267.97 180) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "2aa1a230-be58-4d96-8beb-be2d1f3d3702"))(wire (pts (xy 190.5 234.95)(xy 190.5 227.33)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "0427f8c5-2942-4bca-8550-67031aa64c87"))(global_label "+5V" (shape passive) (at 190.5 227.33 90) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "7093cc89-8f53-42ad-ade0-d020f3250e27"))(wire (pts (xy 190.5 242.57)(xy 190.5 250.19)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "cdeee195-b00b-4fba-ab4c-48ec174c946e"))(global_label "MPG_5V" (shape passive) (at 190.5 250.19 270) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "b8667706-9074-455b-b5c5-4a851d44d1ce"))(wire (pts (xy 154.94 265.43)(xy 162.56 265.43)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "12ec9936-379e-44f6-ad6b-b28c89cd0282"))(global_label "GND" (shape passive) (at 162.56 265.43 180) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "407a1fe9-ff26-4760-a30e-59028cbe1d4b"))(wire (pts (xy 154.94 262.89)(xy 162.56 262.89)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "5fee6468-2801-4fe6-a3e6-a1043e498405"))(global_label "MPG_A_RAW" (shape passive) (at 162.56 